  "title": "Whole Wheat Pumpkin Bread",
  "description": "This whole wheat pumpkin bread recipe is nicely spiced with cloves, cinnamon, and nutmeg and has crunchy walnuts and plump, juicy raisins in each bite.",
  "authors": [
    "Donna Scheletsky"
  ],
